# Versioning

See the chart repo rule for the full checklist. App repo summary:

- **Tags:** `vX.Y.Z` on `main` after merge (e.g. `v0.2.0`)
- **Artifacts:** `ghcr.io/virtfoundry/core:X.Y.Z`, `ghcr.io/virtfoundry/ui:X.Y.Z`
- **CHANGELOG.md** at repo root — update on every release
- Cross-repo releases use the **same version number** as [helm-charts](https://github.com/virtfoundry/helm-charts) `appVersion`

Pre-1.0 SemVer: MINOR for features, PATCH for fixes. English Conventional Commits; release notes in CHANGELOG.
